{"seq":75,"slug":"vector-databases-similarity-search","title":"向量数据库与相似性检索","stage":"DONE","category":"cs-fundamentals","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/vector-databases-similarity-search","rating":{"composite":3.88,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.6,"coverage":3.75,"positioning":3.5,"strategic":4.67},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introMarkdown":"# 向量数据库与相似性检索\n\n把一段文字、一张图片、一段音频压缩成几百到几千个浮点数，再用「谁离谁近」回答「谁和谁像」——这是过去几年里悄悄重塑搜索、推荐与大模型应用的一条主线。当关键词匹配只能命中字面，向量检索却能在语义空间里找到「意思相近但用词不同」的结果，于是它成了 RAG、语义搜索、去重、异常检测共同的底座。\n\n这个 hub 的四章按「从地基到屋顶」的顺序排列，每一章都建立在前一章之上。\n\n第一章「基础」回答三个最根本的问题：向量从哪来、怎么判断两个向量像不像、为什么在高维空间里精确检索会变得不可行。嵌入模型把对象映射成向量，相似度度量给「像」一个可计算的定义，而维度灾难则解释了为什么我们不得不退而求其次，用近似最近邻（ANN）换取可用的速度。没有这一章，后面所有的工程取舍都会显得像凭空冒出来的魔法。\n\n第二章「索引算法」是全 hub 技术密度最高的部分，讲清楚三类主流 ANN 索引：用聚类把空间切块、只搜相关块的 IVF；用分层小世界图做导航式跳跃的 HNSW；以及把向量压缩成几个字节、让十亿级数据装进内存的量化（PQ/SQ/BQ）。它们不是互斥的竞品，而常常组合使用——理解了这三块积木，就能看懂任何一个向量库底层在做什么。\n\n第三章「系统」把算法放进真实产品里。Milvus、Qdrant、Weaviate 各有侧重，混合检索把稠密向量与稀疏关键词融合以兼顾语义与精确，元数据过滤则解决「在某个时间段、某个作者、某个分类下做向量检索」这个看似简单实则棘手的工程难题。\n\n第四章「应用与运维」收口落地：RAG 把检索接进大模型、扩展与性能讲清楚分片复制与内存预算、召回评估与调优给出一套量化迭代的方法论。读完四章，你应当能从「为什么需要它」一路推到「怎么把它跑稳、调好、上规模」。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/vector-databases-similarity-search/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"embeddings-vectors","title":"嵌入与向量表示","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/vector-databases-similarity-search/foundations/embeddings-vectors"},{"seq":2,"slug":"similarity-metrics","title":"相似度度量：余弦、欧氏与点积","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/vector-databases-similarity-search/foundations/similarity-metrics"},{"seq":3,"slug":"vector-search-problem","title":"向量检索问题与维度灾难","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/vector-databases-similarity-search/foundations/vector-search-problem"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"indexing","title":"索引算法","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/vector-databases-similarity-search/indexing","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"ivf-clustering","title":"倒排文件与聚类 IVF","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/vector-databases-similarity-search/indexing/ivf-clustering"},{"seq":2,"slug":"hnsw-graphs","title":"HNSW 图索引","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/vector-databases-similarity-search/indexing/hnsw-graphs"},{"seq":3,"slug":"quantization","title":"量化：PQ 与 SQ","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/vector-databases-similarity-search/indexing/quantization"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"systems","title":"系统","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/vector-databases-similarity-search/systems","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"vector-databases","title":"向量数据库产品：Milvus、Qdrant、Weaviate","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/vector-databases-similarity-search/systems/vector-databases"},{"seq":2,"slug":"hybrid-search","title":"混合检索：稠密与稀疏","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/vector-databases-similarity-search/systems/hybrid-search"},{"seq":3,"slug":"filtering-metadata","title":"元数据过滤与预后过滤","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/vector-databases-similarity-search/systems/filtering-metadata"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"applications","title":"应用与运维","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/vector-databases-similarity-search/applications","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"rag-applications","title":"RAG 与语义检索应用","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/vector-databases-similarity-search/applications/rag-applications"},{"seq":2,"slug":"scaling-performance","title":"扩展与性能","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/vector-databases-similarity-search/applications/scaling-performance"},{"seq":3,"slug":"evaluation-tuning","title":"召回评估与调优","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/vector-databases-similarity-search/applications/evaluation-tuning"}]}]}